#: ../developer/alert-history.md:1
msgid "Alert history"
msgstr "告警历史"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:3
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps a structured history of what its alerting did: each "
"breach it observed, each recovery, each decision not to notify (cooldown,"
" mute, snooze, no channel, a policy switch), each delivery attempt and "
"its result, and the admin console's test notifications. People and agents"
" read it through a scoped, read-only API."
msgstr ""
"网关会结构化地记录告警系统做过的事：观察到的每次越限、每次恢复、每次不发通知的决定（冷却、静音、暂停提醒、没有通道、策略开关），每次投递尝试及其结果，以及管理控制台的测试通知。人和"
" agent 通过一个限定范围的只读 API 读取这些历史。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:5
msgid ""
"Alerting has two independent paths. The gateway's own alerts go through "
"`alert_slack()` to one Slack or WeCom webhook, and the gateway records "
"them as they happen. A status monitor and its alert control plane, "
"deployed outside this repository, deliver their own alerts and can submit"
" what they did to the [ingestion endpoint](#ingestion-api), which only "
"records it."
msgstr ""
"告警有两条相互独立的路径。网关自己的告警通过 `alert_slack()` 发往一个 Slack 或企业微信 "
"webhook，网关在告警发生时记录下来。状态监控及其告警控制面部署在本仓库之外，自行投递告警，并可以把它们做过的事提交到[接收端点"
"](#ingestion-api)，该端点只负责记录。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:7
msgid ""
"History is on whenever the gateway has a database. It never changes what "
"is sent: thresholds, cooldowns, mutes, snoozes, retries, routing and the "
"`bool` that `alert_slack()` and `AlertSink.post()` return are the same "
"with or without it."
msgstr ""
"只要网关有数据库，历史记录就是开启的。它从不改变发送的内容：无论是否开启，阈值、冷却、静音、暂停提醒、重试、路由，以及 "
"`alert_slack()` 和 `AlertSink.post()` 返回的 `bool` 都完全一样。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:9
msgid "What \"kept\" means"
msgstr "“保留”是什么意思"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:11
msgid ""
"Only a committed PostgreSQL row is saved. Capture puts each fact in a "
"bounded in-memory buffer without waiting, and a background writer commits"
" it."
msgstr "只有已提交的 PostgreSQL 行才算保存。采集时会把每条事实非阻塞地放进一个有界的内存缓冲区，再由后台写入器提交。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:12
msgid ""
"History is best effort. A crash, a shutdown that runs out of time, or a "
"buffer that fills during a long database outage loses uncommitted facts. "
"Refused facts are counted and later written as a `history_gap` record, "
"which can be lost too. Every read answer therefore carries `completeness:"
" best_effort`, `unknown_gaps_possible: true` and `late_arrivals_possible:"
" true`, and an empty gap list never proves completeness."
msgstr ""
"历史记录是尽力而为的。崩溃、超时的关闭，或在长时间数据库故障期间被填满的缓冲区，都会丢失未提交的事实。被拒绝的事实会被计数，之后写成一条 "
"`history_gap` 记录，而这条记录本身也可能丢失。因此每个读取结果都带有 `completeness: "
"best_effort`、`unknown_gaps_possible: true` 和 `late_arrivals_possible: "
"true`，空的缺口列表从不证明历史完整。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:13
msgid ""
"History starts the first time the gateway runs with a database and "
"capture on; earlier channel messages are not imported."
msgstr "历史从网关首次在有数据库且开启采集的情况下运行时开始；之前的通道消息不会被导入。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:14
msgid ""
"Nothing deletes history on a timer. Plan database capacity and backups "
"for it, and see [Erasure](#erasure)."
msgstr "没有任何机制会定时删除历史。请为它规划数据库容量和备份，另见[删除](#erasure)。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:16
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL is the only store: no local file, disk spool, SQLite buffer or"
" message broker."
msgstr "PostgreSQL 是唯一的存储：没有本地文件、磁盘暂存、SQLite 缓冲或消息队列。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:18
msgid "Turning it off"
msgstr "关闭"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:20
msgid ""
"Without a database (`DB_ENABLED=false`) nothing is recorded and the read "
"API answers \"not configured\". Credentials and the deployment id only "
"scope who may read and which sources may submit; they don't decide "
"whether the gateway records its own history. The settings are on the "
"admin console's **Settings** tab, under **Alerts**, or in the "
"environment:"
msgstr ""
"没有数据库（`DB_ENABLED=false`）时不会记录任何内容，读取 API 返回“未配置”。凭据和部署 id "
"只限定谁可以读取、哪些来源可以提交；它们不决定网关是否记录自己的历史。这些设置项位于管理控制台的 **Settings** 标签页 "
"**Alerts** 下，也可以通过环境变量设置："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED`"
msgstr "`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid ""
"Capture backend history and accept history from sources with a writer "
"credential. `false` turns both off. Applies after a restart."
msgstr "采集后端历史，并接收持有写入凭据的来源提交的历史。`false` 同时关闭这两项。重启后生效。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`ALERT_HISTORY_DEPLOYMENT_ID`"
msgstr "`ALERT_HISTORY_DEPLOYMENT_ID`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`default`"
msgstr "`default`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid ""
"This deployment's id on every history row; reader credentials are scoped "
"by it. Applies after a restart."
msgstr "写在每一行历史上的本部署 id；只读凭据按它限定范围。重启后生效。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`ALERT_HISTORY_READ_CREDENTIALS`"
msgstr "`ALERT_HISTORY_READ_CREDENTIALS`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "JSON list of read-only credentials (see [Credentials](#credentials))."
msgstr "只读凭据的 JSON 列表（见[凭据](#credentials)）。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`ALERT_HISTORY_WRITER_CREDENTIALS`"
msgstr "`ALERT_HISTORY_WRITER_CREDENTIALS`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "JSON list of source credentials."
msgstr "来源凭据的 JSON 列表。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:29
msgid ""
"`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED` is read once at startup. With no stored value and"
" no environment variable, capture is on. `false` (or `0`, `no`, `off`) "
"turns it off, and a stored value wins over the environment; the default "
"is never written to the database, so a stored `false` stays until someone"
" changes it. A blank value, or a value in the environment that is not a "
"boolean, also keeps capture off, with a warning; remove a blank stored "
"value to return to the default. A stored value that is not a boolean is "
"ignored with a warning, as for every setting."
msgstr ""
"`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED` 只在启动时读取一次。既没有存储值也没有环境变量时，采集开启。`false`（或 "
"`0`、`no`、`off`）关闭采集，存储值优先于环境变量；默认值从不写入数据库，因此存储的 `false` "
"会一直有效，直到有人修改。空值，或环境变量中不是布尔值的值，也会使采集保持关闭并给出警告；删除存储的空值即可恢复默认。存储的非布尔值会被忽略并给出警告，与所有设置项一样。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:31
msgid ""
"With capture off, stored history stays readable, status reports the "
"backend as `disabled`, and the ingestion endpoint answers `404` even to a"
" valid writer credential. The environment on each record comes from "
"`DEPLOYMENT_ENV`, or is inferred from `BASE_URL` as for alert cards."
msgstr ""
"采集关闭时，已存储的历史仍可读取，状态把后端报告为 `disabled`，接收端点即使对有效的写入凭据也返回 `404`。每条记录上的环境取自 "
"`DEPLOYMENT_ENV`，或者像告警卡片那样从 `BASE_URL` 推断。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:33
msgid ""
"The tables, `alert_history_sources` and `alert_history_events`, come from"
" the schema migrations like every other table. History uses its own "
"connection pool of at most four connections, opened on first use, so it "
"never takes a connection the request path needs. If the database is "
"unreachable, history waits, and the gateway still starts and alerts."
msgstr ""
"`alert_history_sources` 和 `alert_history_events` 两张表与其他所有表一样来自 schema "
"迁移。历史记录使用自己的连接池，最多四个连接，首次使用时才打开，因此绝不会占用请求路径需要的连接。数据库不可达时，历史记录会等待，网关照常启动和告警。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:35
msgid "What it costs:"
msgstr "开销："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:37
msgid "Connections: up to four more PostgreSQL connections per gateway process."
msgstr "连接：每个网关进程最多多占用四个 PostgreSQL 连接。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:38
msgid ""
"Writes: each process writes its source row every 30 seconds even when "
"idle, plus one row per fact, in batches flushed every second."
msgstr "写入：每个进程即使空闲也每 30 秒写一次自己的来源行，另外每条事实写一行，按每秒一次的批次刷新。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:39
msgid ""
"Storage: the tables grow with alert activity until you delete rows "
"yourself."
msgstr "存储：表会随告警活动不断增长，直到你自己删除行。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:40
msgid ""
"Shutdown: stopping a process waits up to about 10 seconds for history "
"(see [Buffer, writer and shutdown](#buffer-writer-and-shutdown)); a "
"process manager that kills it sooner loses what was queued."
msgstr ""
"关闭：停止进程时最多会为历史记录等待约 10 秒（见[缓冲区、写入器与关闭](#buffer-writer-and-"
"shutdown)）；更早强制结束进程的进程管理器会丢失尚在队列中的记录。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:42
msgid "What a record holds"
msgstr "一条记录包含什么"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:44
msgid "Each fact is one row with:"
msgstr "每条事实是一行，包含："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:46
msgid ""
"its source identity (`source`, `source_namespace`, `source_instance_id`, "
"`process_id`), the deployment and the environment;"
msgstr "其来源身份（`source`、`source_namespace`、`source_instance_id`、`process_id`）、部署和环境；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:47
msgid ""
"`occurred_at`, by the source's clock, and `recorded_at`, the database "
"clock in the committing transaction;"
msgstr "`occurred_at`（按来源的时钟）和 `recorded_at`（提交事务中的数据库时钟）；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:48
msgid ""
"a `kind`, the alert type, a redacted alert key, the rule id, and "
"`rule_version`, a short hash of the rule configuration in force;"
msgstr "`kind`、告警类型、脱敏后的告警键、规则 id，以及 `rule_version`，即生效规则配置的短哈希；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:49
msgid "allowlisted `facts`;"
msgstr "允许列表内的 `facts`；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:50
msgid ""
"for decisions and deliveries: the reason, channel, outcome, a stable "
"error code and the duration. Delivery attempts carry a redacted message "
"snapshot: the sink's own rendering of the redacted title and fields, with"
" the names of omitted fields and a truncation flag."
msgstr ""
"对于决定和投递：原因、通道、结果、稳定的错误码和耗时。投递尝试带有一份脱敏的消息快照：由 sink "
"自己渲染的脱敏标题和字段，以及被省略字段的名称和截断标记。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:52
msgid ""
"The kinds are `condition_triggered`, `condition_ended`, "
"`notification_decision`, `suppression_summary`, `delivery_attempt`, "
"`delivery_result`, `resolution_retry_terminated`, `history_gap` and "
"`history_conflict` (written only by the store). A backend "
"`condition_ended` has `end_basis` `observed_healthy` (the metric was seen"
" to clear) or `no_samples` (the stale sweep closed it for lack of data), "
"never conflated."
msgstr ""
"类型包括 "
"`condition_triggered`、`condition_ended`、`notification_decision`、`suppression_summary`、`delivery_attempt`、`delivery_result`、`resolution_retry_terminated`、`history_gap`"
" 和 `history_conflict`（只由存储层写入）。后端的 `condition_ended` 带有 "
"`end_basis`：`observed_healthy`（观察到指标恢复正常）或 "
"`no_samples`（过期清理因缺少数据而将其关闭），两者从不混用。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:54
msgid ""
"A delivery outcome is `accepted` (the channel confirmed; for WeCom, HTTP "
"2xx and `errcode == 0`), `rejected` (an explicit refusal), `not_sent` "
"(nothing went out: rendering failed, or the connection was never made) or"
" `unknown` (it may have been sent: a timeout after sending, a "
"cancellation). An attempt without a result reads as `unknown`."
msgstr ""
"投递结果分为 `accepted`（通道已确认；对企业微信而言是 HTTP 2xx 且 `errcode == "
"0`）、`rejected`（被明确拒绝）、`not_sent`（什么都没发出去：渲染失败，或连接从未建立）和 "
"`unknown`（可能已发出：发送后超时、被取消）。没有结果的尝试读作 `unknown`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:56
msgid "What is never kept"
msgstr "哪些内容从不保留"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:58
msgid ""
"Facts are copied only for an allowlist of field names: counts, rates, "
"thresholds, provider, model and endpoint labels, and stable reasons. "
"Every other field (upstream error text, request paths, IP addresses, key "
"prefixes, account lists, request ids) is left out and named in "
"`limitations` as `omitted:<field>`. An allowlisted name does not make a "
"value safe: every kept string, title and snapshot goes through value "
"redaction, which replaces credential headers, `Bearer` and `Basic` "
"values, secret-named `name=value` pairs, well-known token shapes, URL "
"paths and queries, e-mail and IP addresses and long opaque runs, and "
"records `redacted:<field>`. The ingestion endpoint redacts again, "
"whatever a source says it already did."
msgstr ""
"只有允许列表中的字段名才会被复制为事实：计数、比率、阈值、provider、模型和端点标签，以及稳定的原因。其他所有字段（上游错误文本、请求路径、IP"
" 地址、密钥前缀、账号列表、请求 id）都会被省略，并在 `limitations` 中记为 "
"`omitted:<field>`。字段名在允许列表中并不代表其值安全：每个保留的字符串、标题和快照都会经过值脱敏，替换凭据头、`Bearer` "
"和 `Basic` 值、名称带 secret 字样的 `name=value` 对、常见 token 形态、URL 路径和查询串、电子邮件和 IP"
" 地址以及较长的不透明字符串，并记录 `redacted:<field>`。无论来源声称自己是否已经脱敏，接收端点都会再脱敏一次。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:60
msgid ""
"Account identifiers are never stored in the clear. A key that names an "
"account (`cost_overrun:<user>:<day>`) is stored as "
"`cost_overrun:[subject]:<day>`, with the account's erasure-fence digest "
"in `subject_digests`. Without a fence secret the digest is not kept "
"either, and the record says `subject_unfenced`."
msgstr ""
"账号标识从不以明文保存。指向某个账号的键（`cost_overrun:<user>:<day>`）会存为 "
"`cost_overrun:[subject]:<day>`，账号的删除围栏摘要存在 `subject_digests` "
"中。没有围栏密钥时摘要也不保存，记录会注明 `subject_unfenced`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:62
msgid "Episodes"
msgstr "Episode"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:64
msgid ""
"A backend episode is one breach as one process observed it, from the "
"first breached evaluation to the observation that ended it. Workers don't"
" merge episodes, and one worker's recovery does not close another's."
msgstr ""
"一个后端 episode 是一个进程观察到的一次越限，从第一次判定越限开始，到结束它的那次观察为止。各 worker 不会合并 "
"episode，一个 worker 的恢复也不会关闭另一个 worker 的 episode。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:66
msgid ""
"Episodes are separate from the notification tracker. When a recovery card"
" fails to send, the tracker re-arms the key so the card can be retried; "
"the episode stays ended and the retries are attached to it. A send fixes "
"its episode id before it starts, so a result that returns after a new "
"breach never touches the new episode. The new breach opens a new episode "
"and ends the old one's retries (`resolution_retry_terminated`, "
"`superseded_by_new_episode`)."
msgstr ""
"Episode 与通知跟踪器相互独立。恢复卡片发送失败时，跟踪器会重新布防该键，以便重试这张卡片；episode "
"保持已结束状态，重试归入它名下。每次发送在开始前就固定了它的 episode id，因此在新的越限之后才返回的结果绝不会影响新的 "
"episode。新的越限会开启新的 episode，并结束旧 episode "
"的重试（`resolution_retry_terminated`，`superseded_by_new_episode`）。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:68
msgid ""
"A decision not to notify is recorded once per episode and reason; repeats"
" are counted in non-overlapping 30-second windows (`suppression_summary` "
"with `count`, `bucket_start`, `bucket_end` and the first and last times)."
" A breach its producer held back before the alert path (a circuit page "
"turned off by policy, the failed-request detector's cooldown, a disabled "
"`db_disconnect` report) is still recorded, with that decision. Admin test"
" notifications are recorded with `origin: test`, joined to the audit row "
"by their `test_id` (`audit_ref`), and never open an episode."
msgstr ""
"不发通知的决定在每个 episode 中按原因只记录一次；之后的重复按互不重叠的 30 秒窗口计数（`suppression_summary`，带"
" `count`、`bucket_start`、`bucket_end` "
"以及首次和末次时间）。在进入告警路径之前就被其产生方拦下的越限（被策略关闭的熔断告警、失败请求检测器自己的冷却、被禁用的 "
"`db_disconnect` 报告）仍会被记录，并附上该决定。管理员测试通知以 `origin: test` 记录，通过其 "
"`test_id`（`audit_ref`）关联到审计行，并且从不开启 episode。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:70
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "读取"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:72
msgid ""
"Admins use their normal login or `ADMIN_TOKEN`; agents use a scoped "
"reader token. Every endpoint is read-only."
msgstr "管理员使用平常的登录或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`；Agent 使用有范围限制的只读令牌。所有端点都是只读的。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`GET /admin/alert-history/status`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/alert-history/status`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid ""
"One entry per source and target environment (see [Status](#status)). "
"Admins also see the answering worker's own buffer under `this_process`; "
"other workers' buffers are known only from their last written snapshot."
msgstr ""
"每个来源和目标环境一条（见[状态](#status)）。管理员还能在 `this_process` 下看到响应该请求的 worker "
"自己的缓冲区；其他 worker 的缓冲区只能从它们最后写入的快照得知。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "`GET /admin/alert-history/events`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/alert-history/events`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid ""
"Events that occurred in `[since, until)` (default the last 24 hours, at "
"most 7 days per query), filtered by `source`, `source_namespace`, "
"`deployment_id`, `target_environment`, `kind`, `alert_type`, `model_id`, "
"`endpoint_id`, `channel`, `outcome`, `origin`."
msgstr ""
"在 `[since, until)` 内发生的事件（默认最近 24 小时，每次查询最多 7 天），可按 "
"`source`、`source_namespace`、`deployment_id`、`target_environment`、`kind`、`alert_type`、`model_id`、`endpoint_id`、`channel`、`outcome`、`origin`"
" 过滤。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/alert-history/episodes/{episode_id}`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/alert-history/episodes/{episode_id}`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "One backend episode's records."
msgstr "一个后端 episode 的记录。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /admin/alert-history/source-"
"incidents/{source}/{incident_id}?source_namespace=…`"
msgstr ""
"`GET /admin/alert-history/source-"
"incidents/{source}/{incident_id}?source_namespace=…`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid "A source incident across its generations."
msgstr "一个来源事故在各代（generation）中的记录。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/alert-history/request-evidence/{request_id}`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/alert-history/request-evidence/{request_id}`"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md
msgid ""
"Time, model, endpoint, status code, latency and error class of a request "
"that a record in your scope references; nothing else, and nothing for an "
"unreferenced request."
msgstr "你权限范围内的记录所引用的请求的时间、模型、端点、状态码、延迟和错误类别；除此之外什么都不返回，未被引用的请求也不返回任何内容。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:82
msgid ""
"A page holds at most 200 records: 50 by default for events, 200 for "
"timelines. Pages are keyed on `(recorded_at, record_id)` behind an opaque"
" cursor bound to the query. `recorded_at` is the insert time inside the "
"writing transaction, not the commit order, so the API is not a change "
"feed: a record whose transaction commits after a reader's cursor has "
"passed its `recorded_at` appears on no later page. To collect a window "
"completely, rescan its `occurred_at` range from the start and deduplicate"
" by `record_id`. Even that cannot guarantee a record that arrives "
"arbitrarily late, such as a buffered backend record or a source's retry "
"hours later. Sort by `occurred_at` for display."
msgstr ""
"每页最多 200 条记录：事件列表默认 50 条，时间线默认 200 条。分页以 `(recorded_at, record_id)` "
"为键，使用一个与查询绑定的不透明游标。`recorded_at` 是写入事务内的插入时间，不是提交顺序，因此这个 API "
"不是变更流：如果一条记录的事务在读者的游标越过其 `recorded_at` "
"之后才提交，它不会出现在之后的任何一页。要完整收集某个窗口，请从头重新扫描其 `occurred_at` 范围，并按 `record_id` "
"去重。即便如此，也无法保证收到任意晚到的记录，比如缓冲中的后端记录，或来源几小时后的重试。展示时按 `occurred_at` 排序。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:84
msgid ""
"Timelines also return `end_recorded` and a `summary` of the whole "
"timeline in your scope, not just the page. `records`, `generation_count`,"
" `trigger_recorded` and `end_recorded` come from one exact aggregate; "
"`generations` lists at most 100 groups, with `generations_truncated` when"
" there are more. `end_recorded: false` means no end record had been "
"committed when the read ran. It does not mean the condition is still on, "
"and never that it recovered."
msgstr ""
"时间线还会返回 `end_recorded` 和一个 "
"`summary`，覆盖你权限范围内的整条时间线，而不只是当前页。`records`、`generation_count`、`trigger_recorded`"
" 和 `end_recorded` 来自一次精确的聚合；`generations` 最多列出 100 组，更多时带 "
"`generations_truncated`。`end_recorded: false` "
"只表示读取时还没有已提交的结束记录。它不表示条件仍然存在，更不表示已经恢复。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:86
msgid ""
"When the database cannot be read, list endpoints answer `503 "
"history_unavailable` and status says `database: unavailable`; neither "
"answers with an empty history."
msgstr ""
"无法读取数据库时，列表端点返回 `503 history_unavailable`，状态显示 `database: "
"unavailable`；两者都不会返回空的历史。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:88
msgid ""
"Request evidence is checked against the request's owner, whom the record "
"holds only as an erasure-fence digest. The read takes the owner's shared "
"fence lock, so it waits for an erasure in progress and finds nothing "
"after one. Request logs have their own retention, so evidence can be gone"
" while the alert record remains."
msgstr "请求证据会核对请求的所有者，而记录里只以删除围栏摘要的形式保存所有者。读取时会取得该所有者的共享围栏锁，因此会等待正在进行的删除，删除完成后就什么也找不到。请求日志有自己的保留期限，所以告警记录还在时，证据可能已经不存在。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md ../developer/alert-history.md:90
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:92
msgid ""
"`sources` has one entry per `(source, source_namespace, "
"target_environment)`: each target the configuration expects (the "
"backend's environment, and each environment of each writer credential), "
"plus any other target that has reported. Each is looked up on its own, so"
" a busy source or a healthy environment cannot hide another. An entry "
"has:"
msgstr ""
"`sources` 中每个 `(source, source_namespace, target_environment)` "
"一条：配置所期望的每个目标（后端的环境，以及每个写入凭据的每个环境），再加上其他任何报告过的目标。每条单独查询，因此一个繁忙的来源或一个健康的环境不会掩盖另一个。每条包含："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:94
msgid ""
"`connection`: `reporting` (last report within `stale_after_sec`), "
"`stale`, `never_reported` (no report for this target), `disabled` "
"(capture off), or `unknown` when the database cannot be read;"
msgstr ""
"`connection`：`reporting`（最近一次报告在 `stale_after_sec` "
"之内）、`stale`、`never_reported`（这个目标从未报告过）、`disabled`（采集关闭），或在无法读取数据库时为 "
"`unknown`；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:95
msgid ""
"`stale_after_sec`: 180 for the backend, which reports every 30 seconds; "
"for a source, its writer credential's value. A source that reports less "
"often, such as a 20-minute cron job, must set it higher or it shows "
"`stale` between runs;"
msgstr ""
"`stale_after_sec`：后端为 180，后端每 30 秒报告一次；来源则取其写入凭据中的值。报告间隔较长的来源（例如每 20 "
"分钟运行一次的 cron 任务）必须把它设得更大，否则两次运行之间会显示为 `stale`；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:96
msgid ""
"`first_recorded_at` and `last_recorded_at` (committed records about this "
"target), `last_successful_write_at` and `last_report_at`;"
msgstr ""
"`first_recorded_at` 和 "
"`last_recorded_at`（关于该目标的已提交记录）、`last_successful_write_at` 和 "
"`last_report_at`；"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:97
msgid ""
"`instance_count` (a lower bound when `instance_count_is_floor`), the 20 "
"most recently reporting `instances`, and `instances_truncated`. An "
"instance is `running`, `stopped` (it sent a stop record: a backend "
"shutdown, or a completed invocation with `stop_reason: "
"invocation_complete` and its `lost_at_stop`), or `unknown` (no stop "
"record and no recent report; it may have crashed)."
msgstr ""
"`instance_count`（当 `instance_count_is_floor` 为真时是下限）、最近报告过的 20 个 "
"`instances`，以及 `instances_truncated`。实例状态为 "
"`running`、`stopped`（它发送过停止记录：后端关闭，或带 `stop_reason: invocation_complete` "
"及其 `lost_at_stop` 的已完成调用），或 `unknown`（没有停止记录，最近也没有报告；可能已经崩溃）。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:99
msgid ""
"The answer also has `targets_truncated` when there are more than 200 "
"targets, and `known_gaps`: at most 50 gap and conflict records from the "
"last 7 days, with `known_gaps_truncated` and a pointer to the events "
"endpoint for the rest."
msgstr ""
"响应中还有：目标超过 200 个时的 `targets_truncated`，以及 `known_gaps`：最近 7 天内最多 50 "
"条缺口和冲突记录，附 `known_gaps_truncated` 和指向事件端点的提示，以便查看其余部分。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:101
msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "凭据"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:103
msgid ""
"Both lists store only the SHA-256 of each token. Generate a token, keep "
"it in the consumer's own secret store, and put only its hash here:"
msgstr "两个列表都只保存每个 token 的 SHA-256。生成一个 token，把它保存在使用方自己的密钥存储中，这里只放它的哈希："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:110
msgid "A reader credential fixes what its token may read:"
msgstr "读取凭据规定其 token 能读取什么："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:120
msgid ""
"A writer credential fixes the identity of everything its token submits; "
"the request cannot change it:"
msgstr "写入凭据规定其 token 提交的所有内容的身份；请求无法更改："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:133
msgid ""
"`stale_after_sec` is optional (default 180, from 60 to 86400): how long "
"the source may be silent in an environment before status calls it stale. "
"Set it to the reporting interval plus a margin."
msgstr ""
"`stale_after_sec` 可选（默认 180，取值 60 到 "
"86400）：来源在某个环境中可以沉默多久，之后状态才把它判为过时。请设为报告间隔再加一些余量。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:135
msgid "The rules:"
msgstr "规则："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:137
msgid ""
"Tokens shorter than 32 characters are refused, and `expires_at` needs an "
"explicit offset."
msgstr "短于 32 个字符的 token 会被拒绝，`expires_at` 必须带明确的时区偏移。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:138
msgid "`source: backend` is reserved for the gateway."
msgstr "`source: backend` 保留给网关自身。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:139
msgid ""
"Ids and hashes are unique across both lists, and credentials for the same"
" `(source, source_namespace)` must name the same deployment."
msgstr "id 和哈希在两个列表中都必须唯一，同一 `(source, source_namespace)` 的凭据必须指向同一个部署。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:140
msgid ""
"A reader token works only on the read endpoints and a writer token only "
"on the ingestion endpoint; no other admin or internal route accepts "
"either."
msgstr "读取 token 只能用于读取端点，写入 token 只能用于接收端点；其他管理或内部路由都不接受它们。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:142
msgid ""
"Credentials fail closed. A list that does not parse refuses every history"
" token (an admin still gets in with their own credential). So does a "
"configuration this worker cannot confirm is current: settings are re-read"
" every 10 seconds, and when the snapshot in force was last confirmed more"
" than 30 seconds ago, no history token is accepted until a read succeeds."
" A revoked credential therefore stops working everywhere within about 30 "
"seconds, or the endpoint refuses everyone."
msgstr ""
"凭据检查是失败即拒绝的。列表无法解析时，所有历史 token 都会被拒绝（管理员仍可用自己的凭据进入）。当前 worker "
"无法确认配置是否最新时也一样：设置每 10 秒重新读取一次，如果生效的快照上次确认已超过 30 秒，在读取成功之前不接受任何历史 "
"token。因此被吊销的凭据会在约 30 秒内在所有地方失效，否则端点会拒绝所有人。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:144
msgid ""
"To rotate, add the new credential beside the old one (same `source` and "
"`source_namespace` for a writer), give the consumer the new token, "
"confirm it is used (status shows the source reporting), then remove the "
"old entry. To revoke at once, remove the entry. Keep `expires_at` short "
"to limit exposure."
msgstr ""
"轮换时，在旧凭据旁边添加新凭据（对写入凭据而言，`source` 和 `source_namespace` 要相同），把新 token "
"交给使用方，确认新 token 已在使用（状态显示该来源正在报告），再删除旧条目。要立即吊销，删除对应条目即可。把 `expires_at` "
"设得短一些以限制暴露。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:146
msgid "Ingestion API"
msgstr "接收 API"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:154
msgid ""
"A request carries at most 50 events and 256 KiB, and each event at most "
"64 KiB. The answer is `200` only after the transaction holding the batch "
"has committed. Any other answer, or none, means \"not known to be "
"saved\": resend the same events with the same ids. The console proxy "
"forwards this one path, not the whole `/internal` prefix (see [Public "
"path table](public-path-table.md)). It adds no authentication; the "
"gateway admits only a configured writer credential and answers `404` "
"while history is off or no writer is configured."
msgstr ""
"一个请求最多携带 50 个事件、256 KiB，每个事件最多 64 KiB。只有在包含这批事件的事务提交之后，响应才是 "
"`200`。任何其他响应或没有响应，都表示“不确定已保存”：请用相同的 id 重新发送相同的事件。控制台代理只转发这一个路径，而不是整个 "
"`/internal` 前缀（见[公开路径表](public-path-"
"table.md)）。代理不添加任何认证；网关只接受已配置的写入凭据，并在历史关闭或未配置写入凭据时返回 `404`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:156
msgid "A minimal request, with one event and the sending instance's status:"
msgstr "一个最小请求，包含一个事件和发送实例的状态："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:173
msgid ""
"An event requires `origin_record_id` (1–200 characters of "
"`[A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]`, one per fact, fixed by the source before the first "
"submission), `kind`, `occurred_at` (an RFC 3339 string with an explicit "
"offset, at most 400 days in the past and 5 minutes in the future) and "
"`target_environment` (one of the credential's). Optional fields: `origin`"
" (`live`, `test`), `source_instance_id`, `severity`, `alert_type`, "
"`rule_id`, `rule_version`, `source_event_id`, `source_incident_id`, "
"`generation`, `action_id`, `attempt_id`, `observation_scope`, `model_id`,"
" `endpoint_id`, `end_basis`, `decision_reason`, `count`, "
"`bucket_start`/`bucket_end`, `channel`, `outcome`, `error_code` (a stable"
" code, never free text), `duration_ms`, `facts` (a flat object of at most"
" 32 keys with string, number, boolean or null values), `message` "
"(`title`, `body`, `format`, `format_version`, `redacted`, `truncated`, "
"`omitted_fields`) and `external_ref` (`system`, `ref`)."
msgstr ""
"事件必须包含 `origin_record_id`（1–200 个 `[A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]` "
"字符，每条事实一个，由来源在首次提交前确定）、`kind`、`occurred_at`（带明确时区偏移的 RFC 3339 字符串，最多早于当前 "
"400 天、晚于当前 5 分钟）和 "
"`target_environment`（凭据中的环境之一）。可选字段：`origin`（`live`、`test`）、`source_instance_id`、`severity`、`alert_type`、`rule_id`、`rule_version`、`source_event_id`、`source_incident_id`、`generation`、`action_id`、`attempt_id`、`observation_scope`、`model_id`、`endpoint_id`、`end_basis`、`decision_reason`、`count`、`bucket_start`/`bucket_end`、`channel`、`outcome`、`error_code`（稳定的错误码，绝不是自由文本）、`duration_ms`、`facts`（最多"
" 32 个键的扁平对象，值为字符串、数字、布尔值或 "
"null）、`message`（`title`、`body`、`format`、`format_version`、`redacted`、`truncated`、`omitted_fields`）和"
" `external_ref`（`system`、`ref`）。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:175
msgid ""
"Any other field is a `422`, including `source`, `source_namespace` and "
"`deployment_id`, and so is an identifier that contains a credential or an"
" address. Sources cannot send request references, because the gateway "
"cannot prove who owns them. An event without `source_instance_id` (for a "
"fact a source observes again in later runs, so a replay stays a byte-"
"identical duplicate) is kept with `association_incomplete: true` and "
"`no_source_instance` in `limitations`."
msgstr ""
"任何其他字段都会得到 `422`，包括 `source`、`source_namespace` 和 "
"`deployment_id`；含有凭据或地址的标识符也是如此。来源不能发送请求引用，因为网关无法证明这些请求属于谁。没有 "
"`source_instance_id` 的事件（用于来源在之后的运行中会再次观察到的事实，使重放保持为逐字节相同的重复）会以 "
"`association_incomplete: true` 保存，并在 `limitations` 中记上 "
"`no_source_instance`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:177
msgid "Facts"
msgstr "事实"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:179
msgid ""
"Numbers, booleans and nulls are kept under any well-formed name; strings "
"pass validation up to 500 characters. A string fact is kept only under a "
"recognized name, of one of three kinds:"
msgstr "数字、布尔值和 null 可以保存在任何格式正确的名称下；字符串最长 500 个字符可通过校验。字符串事实只在可识别的名称下保留，名称分三类："

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:181
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Codes: the value must be a lowercase code token, "
"`[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_.:-]{0,99}` (for example `control_plane_rpc`, "
"`stale_result_not_applied`, `manual_reconciliation_required`); anything "
"else under these names is dropped: `action_status`, "
"`action_status_after`, `action_type`, `basis`, `check`, `claim_mode`, "
"`commit`, `commit_state`, `control_plane_action`, `cycle_owner`, "
"`db_kind`, `default_owner`, `delivery_owner`, `end_trigger`, "
"`endpoint_id_omitted`, `error_type`, `gate`, `handoff_outcome`, "
"`incident_key_form`, `incident_state`, `lifecycle_action`, "
"`lifecycle_state`, `mode`, `model_id_omitted`, `notification`, "
"`observation_basis`, `phase`, `previous_state`, `probe`, "
"`producer_source`, `reason`, `record_role`, `recovery_notification`, "
"`region`, `role`, `rule_version`, `source_event_id_form`, `state`, "
"`status`, `store`, `task_name`, `transition`, `transport`, `trigger`, "
"`window`."
msgstr ""
"代码：值必须是小写代码 token，`[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_.:-]{0,99}`（例如 "
"`control_plane_rpc`、`stale_result_not_applied`、`manual_reconciliation_required`）；这些名称下的其他值都会被丢弃：`action_status`、`action_status_after`、`action_type`、`basis`、`check`、`claim_mode`、`commit`、`commit_state`、`control_plane_action`、`cycle_owner`、`db_kind`、`default_owner`、`delivery_owner`、`end_trigger`、`endpoint_id_omitted`、`error_type`、`gate`、`handoff_outcome`、`incident_key_form`、`incident_state`、`lifecycle_action`、`lifecycle_state`、`mode`、`model_id_omitted`、`notification`、`observation_basis`、`phase`、`previous_state`、`probe`、`producer_source`、`reason`、`record_role`、`recovery_notification`、`region`、`role`、`rule_version`、`source_event_id_form`、`state`、`status`、`store`、`task_name`、`transition`、`transport`、`trigger`、`window`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:182
msgid ""
"Identifiers: kept as sent, never partly redacted, in the identifier "
"characters `[A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]`, mixed case, at most 200 characters; "
"dropped if they carry an e-mail address, a URL, "
"`bearer`/`authorization`/`password`/`secret`/`api_key` or a known token "
"shape: `monitor_incident_key` (for example `status-monitor:model:Example-"
"Org/Example-Model-1`, `fp:4f2185d2122b562b`)."
msgstr ""
"标识符：按原样保存，绝不部分脱敏，使用标识符字符集 `[A-Za-z0-9._:@/-]`，大小写混合，最多 200 "
"个字符；如果含有电子邮件地址、URL、`bearer`/`authorization`/`password`/`secret`/`api_key`"
" 或已知的 token 形态则被丢弃：`monitor_incident_key`（例如 `status-monitor:model"
":Example-Org/Example-Model-1`、`fp:4f2185d2122b562b`）。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:183
msgid ""
"Labels: printable, cut to 200 characters, redacted: `alert`, "
"`availability`, `budget`, `endpoint_id`, `first_at`, `first_lost_at`, "
"`hour`, `hourly_spend`, `last_at`, `last_lost_at`, `model`, `over_by`, "
"`provider`, `quota`, `rate`, `spend`, `top_endpoints`, `top_error_types`,"
" `top_providers`, `top_status_codes`."
msgstr ""
"标签：可打印字符，截断为 200 "
"个字符并脱敏：`alert`、`availability`、`budget`、`endpoint_id`、`first_at`、`first_lost_at`、`hour`、`hourly_spend`、`last_at`、`last_lost_at`、`model`、`over_by`、`provider`、`quota`、`rate`、`spend`、`top_endpoints`、`top_error_types`、`top_providers`、`top_status_codes`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:185
msgid ""
"Every other string fact (a note, an error message, a prompt, a request "
"body) is dropped and named in `limitations` as `omitted:<name>`, and so "
"is any fact whose name marks a secret, whatever its type. The same rules "
"apply to `source_status.rules_snapshot`, which holds at most 64 keys and "
"16 KiB. The names follow the technical field inventory of the status "
"monitor and its alert control plane, so adding one is a contract change "
"on both sides. A handoff to an intermediary (`channel: other`, `outcome: "
"unknown`) keeps the facts that explain it, such as `transport`, "
"`delivery_owner`, `handoff_outcome`, `control_plane_action`, "
"`lifecycle_state` and `commit`."
msgstr ""
"其他所有字符串事实（备注、错误信息、提示词、请求体）都会被丢弃，并在 `limitations` 中记为 "
"`omitted:<name>`；名称表明是密钥的事实不论类型也一样处理。同样的规则适用于 "
"`source_status.rules_snapshot`，它最多 64 个键、16 "
"KiB。这些名称来自状态监控及其告警控制面的技术字段清单，因此新增名称是双方的契约变更。交给中间方的投递（`channel: "
"other`、`outcome: unknown`）会保留解释它的事实，例如 "
"`transport`、`delivery_owner`、`handoff_outcome`、`control_plane_action`、`lifecycle_state`"
" 和 `commit`。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:187
msgid "Identity, deduplication and the answer"
msgstr "身份、去重与响应"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:189
msgid ""
"An event's identity is `(source, source_namespace, origin_record_id)`, "
"the first two from the credential. The server computes `payload_digest`, "
"the SHA-256 of the canonical JSON of the validated, redacted event (keys "
"sorted, timestamps normalized to UTC microseconds, absent and null fields"
" dropped). The same identity and digest is a duplicate: nothing is "
"written and the original `record_id` comes back. The same identity with "
"another digest is a conflict: the stored fact stays, and the losing "
"version is kept as a `history_conflict` row with only its digest and "
"kind. Validation and scope errors fail the whole request; duplicates and "
"conflicts are reported per item."
msgstr ""
"事件的身份是 `(source, source_namespace, origin_record_id)`，前两项来自凭据。服务器计算 "
"`payload_digest`，即经过校验和脱敏的事件规范化 JSON 的 SHA-256（键排序，时间戳规范化为 UTC 微秒，省略缺失和为 "
"null 的字段）。身份和摘要都相同即为重复：不写入任何内容，并返回原来的 "
"`record_id`。身份相同而摘要不同即为冲突：已存储的事实保持不变，落选的版本作为一行 `history_conflict` "
"保存，只含其摘要和类型。校验和权限错误会使整个请求失败；重复和冲突则逐条报告。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:191
msgid ""
"Derive ids from the source fact, for example "
"`inc:<incident>:g<generation>:triggered` or `act:<action>:a<n>:result`, "
"never from the submission time, a random value per retry, or the message "
"text."
msgstr ""
"id 应根据来源事实生成，例如 `inc:<incident>:g<generation>:triggered` 或 "
"`act:<action>:a<n>:result`，绝不能根据提交时间、每次重试的随机值或消息文本生成。"

