#: ../developer/alert-history.md:215
msgid ""
"A source keeps no undeclared local copy, bounds its retries by its own "
"execution budget, and later reports what it gave up on as a "
"`history_gap`. The endpoint runs in the gateway, so a gateway outage is "
"also an ingestion outage, which sources see as failed or unknown "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"来源不保留未声明的本地副本，按自身的执行预算限制重试次数，之后把放弃的部分报告为 "
"`history_gap`。接收端点运行在网关中，因此网关故障也就是接收故障，来源会把它视为失败或结果未知的提交。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:217
msgid "Source status"
msgstr "来源状态"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:219
msgid ""
"`source_status` is the sending instance's heartbeat; `events` may be "
"empty. It requires `source_instance_id`, `target_environment` and "
"`observed_at`; `release_id`, `started_at`, `sync_watermark`, "
"`pending_count`, `pending_reported_at`, `dropped_count`, "
"`last_error_code`, `rules_snapshot_hash` and `rules_snapshot` (flat, like"
" `facts`) are optional. Stored timestamps never move backwards, and the "
"read API presents the snapshot as last reported, not as live state."
msgstr ""
"`source_status` 是发送实例的心跳；`events` 可以为空。它必须包含 "
"`source_instance_id`、`target_environment` 和 "
"`observed_at`；`release_id`、`started_at`、`sync_watermark`、`pending_count`、`pending_reported_at`、`dropped_count`、`last_error_code`、`rules_snapshot_hash`"
" 和 `rules_snapshot`（与 `facts` 一样是扁平的）是可选的。存储的时间戳从不倒退，读取 API "
"把快照呈现为最后报告的内容，而不是实时状态。"

#: ../developer/alert-history.md:221
msgid ""
"A short-lived producer (one cron run, one RPC, one alarm) closes its "
"instance in its final status with `stopped_at` (RFC 3339 with an offset),"
" `stop_reason: \"invocation_complete\"` and `lost_at_stop` (0 to 10^9, "
"the records it knows it lost). Send all three or none, and only with "
"`pending_count: 0`: a stop with work still queued, or without "
"`pending_count`, is a `422`. `stopped_at` may not precede `started_at` or"
" lie more than 5 minutes ahead. Only a committed `200` with "
"`source_status: \"recorded\"` confirms the stop. The instance then reads "
"as `stopped`, not as a crashed `unknown`; unknown gaps stay possible."
msgstr ""
"短生命周期的产生方（一次 cron 运行、一次 RPC、一次告警）在其最终状态中用 `stopped_at`（带时区偏移的 RFC "
"3339）、`stop_reason: \"invocation_complete\"` 和 `lost_at_stop`（0 到 "
"10^9，它已知丢失的记录数）关闭自己的实例。三者要么都发，要么都不发，并且只能与 `pending_count: 0` "
"一起发送：仍有排队工作的停止，或没有 `pending_count` 的停止，都会得到 `422`。`stopped_at` 不能早于 "
"`started_at`，也不能超前 5 分钟以上。只有已提交且带 `source_status: \"recorded\"` 的 `200` "
"才确认停止。此后该实例读作 `stopped`，而不是崩溃的 `unknown`；未知缺口仍可能存在。"

